            "content": "CAUTION"
          },
          {
            "role": "body",
            "content_kind": "rich_text",
            "content": "This product does not support 0 ms switching. Do not connect it to equipment that requires an uninterrupted power supply, such as data servers or workstations.\nBefore use, please test compatibility with your device multiple times.\nIt is recommended to connect one device at a time. Do not use multiple devices simultaneously, as this may trigger overload protection.\nThe UPS function works only when a single unit is connected directly to a wall outlet. Do not connect multiple portable power stations in series (cascade connection). In a cascaded setup, the UPS function will not operate: the unit may fail to switch over during a power outage, causing connected devices to shut down."
          },
          {
            "role": "items",
            "content_kind": "list_items",
            "content": [
              "This product does not support 0 ms switching. Do not connect it to equipment that requires an uninterrupted power supply, such as data servers or workstations.",
              "Before use, please test compatibility with your device multiple times.",
              "It is recommended to connect one device at a time. Do not use multiple devices simultaneously, as this may trigger overload protection.",
